25
00:00:18,461 --> 00:00:19,230
panowaniem Mieszka[1][2][3][4]. Syn Mieszka,

26
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,000
Bolesław Chrobry, w 1025

27
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,769
